/E (The analysis reduced the dataset from 20 attributes to 5 key attributes: tenure, OnlineSecurity, TechSupport, Contract, and PaymentMethod. These attributes were identified as the most influential factors affecting customer churn. The reduced dataset improves model interpretability and reduces computational complexity.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
